<h1>Thank you, we have your enquiry</h1>
<p class="lead">The admissions office will call you back on the number you gave.</p>
<h2>What happens next</h2>
<ol class="steps">
  <li>Admissions reads your enquiry.</li>
  <li>They call or WhatsApp you on the number you gave. If you added an email address, you will also get a copy by email.</li>
</ol>
<p>Can’t wait? <a href="https://wa.me/{{ settings.whatsapp_link }}?text={{ settings.whatsapp_message | urlencode }}" rel="noopener">WhatsApp admissions <span class="small">(opens WhatsApp)</span></a>.</p>
